docs {
  ## GET /api/admin/plans

  Lists all subscription plans available on the platform.

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "plans": [
      {
        "id": "...",
        "name": "Starter",
        "service": "RECOMMENDATION",
        "quota": 500,
        "priceEgp": 299,
        "isActive": true
      },
      {
        "id": "...",
        "name": "Growth",
        "service": "RECOMMENDATION",
        "quota": 5000,
        "priceEgp": 999,
        "isActive": true
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
